  dialogueLines:
  - '*Long ago, when evil ruled the world)'
  - There was the most brutal and horrible of all...
  - Scathon.
  - After decades of brutal slaughter and terror, he suddenly started feeling guilt
  - And on one faithful day, he redeemed himself.
  - Instead, he became Aethon. Blowing orb, but he never fully recovered
  - 'He still can turn back... '
